All observations were made by the implementing agent. Automated checks and
native captures support AC-01–AC-05, but no independent review or validation was
performed, so they are not approved here. AC-06 depends on the recorded complete
Toolbox run and the pre-existing pedantic-lint findings. AC-07 awaits the
maintainer. Resumption: review the captures or run the app, then record the
maintainer decision and, if desired, an independent validation bound to the
current input hashes.
